{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_15_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_15","textTraditional":"一、四年，春正月，公狩于郎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_15_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_15","textTraditional":"狩者何？田狩也，春曰苗，秋曰蒐，冬曰狩。常事不書，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？遠也。諸侯曷為必田狩？一曰乾豆，二曰賓客，三百充君之庖。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_15_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_15","textTraditional":"二、夏，天王使宰渠伯糾來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_15_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_15","textTraditional":"宰渠伯糾者何？天子之大夫也。其稱宰渠伯糾何？下大夫也。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}